171
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:57,400
<font color="#ffffff">Dad, do you know who did this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:15:57,480 --> 00:16:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">Who'd dare send the cops</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to arrest us at home?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

173
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,840
<font color="#ffffff">Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">Superintendent Cheewin</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">can't protect you anymore.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

177
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon is handling this personally.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">Who's protecting whom exactly?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Watch your mouth.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

179
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">Show my dad some respect.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:37,000
<font color="#ffffff">Leave this diamond thing alone,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:41,360
<font color="#ffffff">or your whole business will be ruined.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:45,520
<font color="#ffffff">Superintendent Cheewin has already</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">confessed all to Deputy Papon.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

183
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:56,680
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Who the hell are you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to threaten my dad like this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

184
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:59,400
<font color="#ffffff">My dad knows the Minister.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:02,320
<font color="#ffffff">You and your boss are finished.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Get ready to be sidelined!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

186
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:06,200
<font color="#ffffff">Who is that guy, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,280
<font color="#ffffff">Papon,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">you will pay for this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:17,160
<font color="#ffffff">They got bailed out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,160
<font color="#ffffff">Let it be.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

191
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:24,640
<font color="#ffffff">At least they'll know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who they're messing with.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

192
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:27,720
<font color="#ffffff">And they'll know…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,880
<font color="#ffffff">We can get to them anytime.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'm still baffled.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">How did Sawaeng know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
00:17:36,320 --> 00:17:40,920
<font color="#ffffff">exactly when we'd stage</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond heist for the insurance?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

197
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:44,160
<font color="#ffffff">He even sent Lek to steal it from us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:20,920
<font color="#ffffff">The insurance company</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">valued my diamond at 300 million baht.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

199
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:32,480
<font color="#ffffff">If I get that money,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

200
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:37,360
<font color="#ffffff">my hotel business can survive.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:18:40,320 --> 00:18:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">Can you help me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:46,160
<font color="#ffffff">Don't tell me…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:50,320
<font color="#ffffff">You want me to stage a diamond heist</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for the insurance money.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

204
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:53,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:56,520
<font color="#ffffff">All you have to do…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:18:57,080 --> 00:19:01,040
<font color="#ffffff">is fool the insurance company.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:03,360
<font color="#ffffff">That's all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:14,800
<font color="#ffffff">Go take care of it. No mistakes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,720
<font color="#ffffff">Leave no trail back to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:23,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you really risking all this</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to help Yok get the insurance money?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

211
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:27,720
<font color="#ffffff">If you get caught,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">it's not worth losing your position.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

212
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:29,200
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think I'm stupid?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:34,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm keeping the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">Once you get the diamond,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:42,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll tell Yok that you double-crossed us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">After that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:49,240
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond will disappear forever.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:51,600
<font color="#ffffff">So…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:54,840
<font color="#ffffff">are you going to double-cross Ms. Yok?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,480
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:19:57,600 --> 00:19:59,440
<font color="#ffffff">She gets the insurance money.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

222
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">And we keep the diamonds as our fee.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:23,840
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Yok,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:29,440
<font color="#ffffff">the bank and insurance staff are here</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to transfer the diamonds to the vault.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

225
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:31,400
<font color="#ffffff">Send them in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you for your help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:20:52,080 --> 00:20:55,680
<font color="#ffffff">This pink diamond is extremely valuable,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:59,760
<font color="#ffffff">so I want it kept</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the safest place possible.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

229
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, ma'am.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:21:01,800 --> 00:21:04,680
<font color="#ffffff">We've arranged the best</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">security possible for you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

231
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,200
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:13,880
<font color="#ffffff">Then, please sign here</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to confirm the transfer.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

233
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,320
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, ma'am.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">-All done, ma'am.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Thank you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

235
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'll take my leave then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:21:29,040 --> 00:21:30,120
<font color="#ffffff">Of course.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:48,040
<font color="#ffffff">Hello.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

238
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,400
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:56,280
<font color="#ffffff">The bank staff has the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:59,200
<font color="#ffffff">You're good to go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:27,280
<font color="#ffffff">That's Lek, Kamnan Sawaeng's man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:22:34,600 --> 00:22:37,360
<font color="#ffffff">Paul, get out of there! Hurry!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:22:40,240 --> 00:22:41,880
<font color="#ffffff">Is it possible…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Yok knew our plan</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and had someone else hijack it?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

245
00:22:52,320 --> 00:22:55,360
<font color="#ffffff">This is all because of you, Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:22:56,480 --> 00:22:58,560
<font color="#ffffff">If you hadn't tried to double-cross me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:02,000
<font color="#ffffff">none of this mess would have happened.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">What's up, Lieutenant Ae?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:23:19,200 --> 00:23:20,680
<font color="#ffffff">Something came up, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

250
00:23:20,760 --> 00:23:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">The duty officer said someone just called</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the Ban Dao Dap Police Station.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

251
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:26,920
<font color="#ffffff"><i>He claims to be your former subordinate.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:30,400
<font color="#ffffff"><i>He wants a private meeting,</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>and insists you come by yourself.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

253
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">I suspect it might be Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

254
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:40,600
<font color="#ffffff">I've already given strict orders</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">not to tell Superintendent Cheewin.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

255
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:43,160
<font color="#ffffff">We're waiting for your orders.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:46,560
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise, he'll just turn Chansuek over</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to Sawaeng.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

257
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:06,840
<font color="#ffffff">How did it go? Did you find him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:09,440
<font color="#ffffff">No trace, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">Same for me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:17,640
<font color="#ffffff">-Any sign of him?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Not a trace.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

261
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:19,240
<font color="#ffffff">I looked everywhere in town.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:24:19,320 --> 00:24:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">I asked around, but nobody saw a thing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

263
00:24:24,280 --> 00:24:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">I've been meditating since 3 a.m.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:24:28,400 --> 00:24:29,560
<font color="#ffffff">And I haven't seen him at all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:24:32,760 --> 00:24:35,000
<font color="#ffffff">Wait, Saranya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

266
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:40,680
<font color="#ffffff">Did Boonrod ever say anything to you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:24:40,760 --> 00:24:43,880
<font color="#ffffff">Did he mention where he was going,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">or anything at all?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

268
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:49,800
<font color="#ffffff">He probably went to turn himself in,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just as he said.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

269
00:24:54,080 --> 00:24:55,440
<font color="#ffffff">Or maybe…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:24:57,800 --> 00:24:59,320
<font color="#ffffff">Personally,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:01,440
<font color="#ffffff">I believe that like attracts like.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:06,120
<font color="#ffffff">A boss usually draws in</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the same type of people as himself.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

273
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,960
<font color="#ffffff">Simply put,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:25:09,560 --> 00:25:13,120
<font color="#ffffff">birds of a feather flock together.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:25:14,560 --> 00:25:15,560
<font color="#ffffff">Wait…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:17,960
<font color="#ffffff">-Are you saying that…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Exactly.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

277
00:25:18,680 --> 00:25:21,040
<font color="#ffffff">Do you want to know who you really were?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,880
<font color="#ffffff">Do some digging on your boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:25:26,120 --> 00:25:27,840
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:25:43,120 --> 00:25:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">There it is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:25:53,320 --> 00:25:55,640
<font color="#ffffff">That's him. Deputy Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:59,200
<font color="#ffffff">DEPUTY PAPON ORDERS TRAFFICKING CRACKDOWN</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:26:10,320 --> 00:26:11,920
<font color="#ffffff">That's what I told him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:15,640
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe Boonrod went to find Deputy Papon?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">Do you want to know who you really were?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:26:51,800 --> 00:26:53,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do some digging on your boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:26:56,080 --> 00:26:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:27:04,800 --> 00:27:06,240
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Is this Ban Dao Dap Police Station?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:27:06,320 --> 00:27:08,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, it is. How can I help you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:27:08,560 --> 00:27:13,080
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I heard Deputy Papon is here from Bangkok.</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Can I see him, please?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

291
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:15,440
<font color="#ffffff">Who are you? What is this about?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

292
00:27:16,120 --> 00:27:17,320
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:20,280
<font color="#ffffff">Just tell him I'm an old subordinate.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:27:20,360 --> 00:27:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">If he wants to see me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:27:22,560 --> 00:27:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">tell him to meet me in the forest</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">behind Ban Dao Dap Temple.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

296
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:41,680
<font color="#ffffff">DEPUTY PAPON</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:44,280
<font color="#ffffff"><i>You're the only one who can answer me.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:28:38,200 --> 00:28:39,560
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:46,520
<font color="#ffffff">He actually came.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:28:47,640 --> 00:28:52,040
<font color="#ffffff">Let's grab him and interrogate him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">about the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

301
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:54,160
<font color="#ffffff">Don't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:57,360
<font color="#ffffff">The boss ordered us not to get involved.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:29:12,040 --> 00:29:13,680
<font color="#ffffff">Are you Deputy Papon?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:29:14,760 --> 00:29:15,720
<font color="#ffffff">Why?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:20,600
<font color="#ffffff">Are you saying you have amnesia, Chansuek?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:29:23,560 --> 00:29:25,720
<font color="#ffffff">What's with that look?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:29:25,800 --> 00:29:26,760
<font color="#ffffff">You don't believe me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,960
<font color="#ffffff">Then interrogate me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:29:30,040 --> 00:29:32,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm here to turn myself in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:38,840
<font color="#ffffff">I think we'd better talk</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">somewhere more private.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

312
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:40,360
<font color="#ffffff">Why go somewhere else?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:44,320
<font color="#ffffff">Are you taking me to Kamnan Sawaeng?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:29:45,080 --> 00:29:46,760
<font color="#ffffff">Why would I do that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:29:48,080 --> 00:29:49,120
<font color="#ffffff">Who knows?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:52,560
<font color="#ffffff">The police are all in Sawaeng's pocket.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Not me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:06,280
<font color="#ffffff">If you're scared</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:30:06,360 --> 00:30:08,000
<font color="#ffffff">or don't trust me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:30:08,080 --> 00:30:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">you're free to leave.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:14,040
<font color="#ffffff">All right, let's get down to business.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm surprised, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">It's bold of you to turn yourself in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:25,720
<font color="#ffffff">I've done nothing wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Why would I be afraid?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

325
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:35,000
<font color="#ffffff">Let me tell you something.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I've already tried turning myself in,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

326
00:30:35,560 --> 00:30:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">but the local police</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just handed me over to Sawaeng.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

327
00:30:40,360 --> 00:30:42,360
<font color="#ffffff">I knew nothing about that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:30:43,840 --> 00:30:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm here because</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:47,720
<font color="#ffffff">someone mentioned that you're my boss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

330
00:30:50,560 --> 00:30:51,600
<font color="#ffffff">Who?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

331
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,680
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">What's that got to do with him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:02,440
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Is it possible</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>he really forgot everything?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

334
00:31:05,120 --> 00:31:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">I was told</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:09,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm an undercover officer</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:31:10,280 --> 00:31:12,000
<font color="#ffffff">who ended up stealing the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:31:12,080 --> 00:31:13,760
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

338
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">I sent you undercover</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:20,880
<font color="#ffffff">to recover the diamond</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng stole.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

340
00:31:23,320 --> 00:31:26,280
<font color="#ffffff">Before you disappeared</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">along with the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

341
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">where is the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:31:43,120 --> 00:31:45,400
<font color="#ffffff">Why does everyone think</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I have the diamond?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

344
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:48,600
<font color="#ffffff">Are you telling me you're clueless?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:50,680
<font color="#ffffff">I don't remember.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:52,440
<font color="#ffffff">I was injured.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:31:53,280 --> 00:31:56,800
<font color="#ffffff">When I woke up,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond was already gone.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

348
00:31:57,560 --> 00:31:59,600
<font color="#ffffff">I don't even know who I am.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:32:00,520 --> 00:32:01,800
<font color="#ffffff">Captain,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:05,800
<font color="#ffffff">do you really expect me to believe that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:11,240
<font color="#ffffff">That you're not just faking this amnesia</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to keep the diamond for yourself?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

352
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:15,480
<font color="#ffffff">Was I truly that bad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:32:19,760 --> 00:32:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">You're my superior, aren't you?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You should know me better than anyone.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

354
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:25,240
<font color="#ffffff">If you didn't trust me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">you wouldn't have sent me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on a mission this important.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

356
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yes,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

357
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:34,080
<font color="#ffffff">you're right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:32:35,120 --> 00:32:37,840
<font color="#ffffff">In my eyes,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Chansuek was a good man.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

359
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:40,120
<font color="#ffffff">But that was in the past.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:43,360
<font color="#ffffff">Now, you're with Luang Pho Suea.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:32:46,120 --> 00:32:49,320
<font color="#ffffff">I don't get it. What does Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">have to do with this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

362
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:53,960
<font color="#ffffff">Are you working with him to fool me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

363
00:32:54,040 --> 00:32:56,880
<font color="#ffffff">or is your memory actually gone?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

364
00:32:58,280 --> 00:33:00,360
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me, what does he have</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to do with this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

365
00:33:04,080 --> 00:33:05,920
<font color="#ffffff">Do you remember Sergeant Padej?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:33:08,320 --> 00:33:09,160
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:12,040
<font color="#ffffff">The name sounds familiar.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:15,280
<font color="#ffffff">Who is he?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:33:18,360 --> 00:33:21,320
<font color="#ffffff">He's the man you put behind bars</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">six years ago.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

370
00:33:22,720 --> 00:33:23,880
<font color="#ffffff">So what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

371
00:33:25,920 --> 00:33:26,840
<font color="#ffffff">Fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

372
00:33:27,600 --> 00:33:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'll believe that you've lost</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">your memory, Captain.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

373
00:33:32,800 --> 00:33:34,240
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant Padej of back then…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:39,800
<font color="#ffffff">is Luang Pho Suea of today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:33:42,560 --> 00:33:43,600
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:34:02,680 --> 00:34:05,040
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:09,840
<font color="#ffffff">If Boonrod really turns himself in,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:13,159
<font color="#ffffff">then going to Bangkok would be pointless.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:34:13,239 --> 00:34:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">We need to find out the truth first,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:19,960
<font color="#ffffff">where he is</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and whether he's dead or alive.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

381
00:34:20,560 --> 00:34:22,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'll get a reporter friend to investigate.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:34:38,560 --> 00:34:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan, why are you here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:34:42,120 --> 00:34:45,199
<font color="#ffffff">I told you not to come!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

384
00:34:45,280 --> 00:34:47,400
<font color="#ffffff">What if Papon sees you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

385
00:34:52,239 --> 00:34:56,320
<font color="#ffffff">I had to come.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Papon has started targeting us.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

386
00:34:58,800 --> 00:35:00,040
<font color="#ffffff">What happened?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:02,920
<font color="#ffffff">Papon framed me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

388
00:35:03,600 --> 00:35:06,560
<font color="#ffffff">My men and I just managed</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to get out on bail.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

389
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:12,480
<font color="#ffffff">He threatened to send the police</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to shut down my underground business<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

390
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:15,280
<font color="#ffffff">if I don't stop hunting down Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:35:16,040 --> 00:35:18,080
<font color="#ffffff">This is getting completely out of hand.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sure it's Papon's doing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:35:23,240 --> 00:35:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">He's trying to clear the way</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for his henchman, Paul.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

394
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:31,440
<font color="#ffffff">You need to help me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

395
00:35:32,040 --> 00:35:33,120
<font color="#ffffff">Help you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:35:33,680 --> 00:35:35,160
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want me to do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:35:36,240 --> 00:35:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">Just do something about it, and do it now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:40,720
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:43,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'll expose him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'll tell everyone</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:35:45,560 --> 00:35:47,360
<font color="#ffffff">he's planning to steal</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond for himself.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

402
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:49,400
<font color="#ffffff">Don't do that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

403
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:50,960
<font color="#ffffff">You can't do that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:35:51,560 --> 00:35:53,400
<font color="#ffffff">If you do that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:56,200
<font color="#ffffff">the media will start hounding me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:35:56,280 --> 00:35:58,040
<font color="#ffffff">You have to do something to help me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

407
00:35:58,760 --> 00:36:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">You're the reason for all my troubles!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:36:02,080 --> 00:36:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">You can't just pin this all on me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

409
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:06,560
<font color="#ffffff">It's your fault too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:10,000
<font color="#ffffff">If you hadn't sent Lek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to steal the diamond,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

411
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:13,080
<font color="#ffffff">they would never have found out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:36:13,160 --> 00:36:17,760
<font color="#ffffff">They only know now</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">because Lek is your man!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

413
00:36:17,840 --> 00:36:19,280
<font color="#ffffff">I don't care.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:36:20,280 --> 00:36:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">If you won't help me, then so be it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:36:23,840 --> 00:36:26,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'll do whatever it takes to survive.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:44,760
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod is back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:36:46,120 --> 00:36:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:36:52,720 --> 00:36:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:37:02,040 --> 00:37:05,200
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod! Where have you been?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:08,320
<font color="#ffffff">You've had us all looking for you.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">We thought you got captured!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

421
00:37:10,120 --> 00:37:12,080
<font color="#ffffff">Did you turn yourself in?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

422
00:37:14,640 --> 00:37:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">I just went for a walk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:19,440
<font color="#ffffff">A walk? Are you kidding me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

424
00:37:22,440 --> 00:37:24,160
<font color="#ffffff">I went into the village</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to get some medicine.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

425
00:37:24,240 --> 00:37:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">My stomach hurt.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:29,360
<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you tell anyone?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

427
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:32,960
<font color="#ffffff">Never mind.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:37:33,560 --> 00:37:34,600
<font color="#ffffff">Let it go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:37:37,200 --> 00:37:39,480
<font color="#ffffff">It's good that he's back, at least.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:37:40,400 --> 00:37:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">All right, let's pack up.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Our ride is almost here.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

431
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">Boss, he's here!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:38:03,600 --> 00:38:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you let him go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:38:06,600 --> 00:38:10,560
<font color="#ffffff">I really think Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">has lost his memory.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

434
00:38:12,240 --> 00:38:13,400
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sure?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

435
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't just let him go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:38:22,520 --> 00:38:27,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm using him to track down</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and retrieve the diamond for us.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

437
00:38:58,720 --> 00:38:59,840
<font color="#ffffff">So…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:03,120
<font color="#ffffff">I knew Luang Pho Suea in the past?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:39:05,080 --> 00:39:07,320
<font color="#ffffff">He never told you about it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:39:11,680 --> 00:39:16,280
<font color="#ffffff">Why wouldn't he want you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to remember your past?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

441
00:39:18,400 --> 00:39:20,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sure he has his reasons.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:39:20,680 --> 00:39:23,360
<font color="#ffffff">That's true.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:25,800
<font color="#ffffff">But what could his reasons possibly be?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

444
00:39:27,760 --> 00:39:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">How can I trust what you're saying?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

445
00:39:30,520 --> 00:39:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">You might just be making this up</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to make me suspicious of him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

446
00:39:35,520 --> 00:39:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">You said it yourself,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond isn't with you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

447
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">So why would I play games like that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:39:44,960 --> 00:39:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">Before you lost contact,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

449
00:39:47,640 --> 00:39:51,280
<font color="#ffffff">you sent us a message</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">saying you had the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

450
00:39:52,040 --> 00:39:54,920
<font color="#ffffff">If you really don't have it now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

451
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:58,880
<font color="#ffffff">then it must be with the person</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who found you first, right?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

452
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,400
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

453
00:40:06,440 --> 00:40:10,560
<font color="#ffffff">If you want us to trust you again</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and prove you didn't betray us,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

454
00:40:11,240 --> 00:40:13,120
<font color="#ffffff">then just finish the mission.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:40:15,280 --> 00:40:17,040
<font color="#ffffff">Prove your innocence…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:40:18,080 --> 00:40:20,600
<font color="#ffffff">by bringing me that diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

457
00:40:24,680 --> 00:40:26,360
<font color="#ffffff">How did I get here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:40:27,040 --> 00:40:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">I found you unconscious by the stream.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:40:31,080 --> 00:40:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">The current must have carried you there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:40:33,680 --> 00:40:36,600
<font color="#ffffff">Seriously, don't you remember</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

461
00:40:36,680 --> 00:40:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">what mission brought you into this forest?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:40:39,200 --> 00:40:40,680
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

463
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:43,040
<font color="#ffffff">you talk as if you know me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:40:44,840 --> 00:40:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">And do you think you remember me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

465
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:53,440
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Why did he keep all these secrets from me,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:40:53,520 --> 00:40:57,400
<font color="#ffffff"><i>even though he risked his life</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>to protect me time and time again?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

467
00:40:58,520 --> 00:41:00,320
<font color="#ffffff">Who can I even trust at this point?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:41:09,840 --> 00:41:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

469
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,400
<font color="#ffffff">why would you do that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

470
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you tell anyone before leaving?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:18,880
<font color="#ffffff">Do you have any idea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">how worried everyone was about you?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

472
00:41:20,520 --> 00:41:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:41:22,560 --> 00:41:25,400
<font color="#ffffff">You said you were going</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to turn yourself in last night,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

474
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:27,480
<font color="#ffffff">and we all believed you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

475
00:41:29,080 --> 00:41:31,040
<font color="#ffffff">I want this to end with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:41:31,120 --> 00:41:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried about Luang Pho,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and I'm worried about you too.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

477
00:41:43,320 --> 00:41:45,320
<font color="#ffffff">Since I started this new life…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">as Boonrod,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:41:47,760 --> 00:41:49,960
<font color="#ffffff">the only people who matter in my life</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:41:50,040 --> 00:41:51,400
<font color="#ffffff">are Luang Pho…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:54,080
<font color="#ffffff">and you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:41:58,600 --> 00:42:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you realize</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:42:00,880 --> 00:42:03,120
<font color="#ffffff">that you're just as important to me too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:07,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

485
00:42:12,720 --> 00:42:14,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:43:00,920 --> 00:43:02,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

487
00:43:03,920 --> 00:43:06,120
<font color="#ffffff">You see me as someone important too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

489
00:43:13,400 --> 00:43:16,520
<font color="#ffffff">We have been through</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">life and death together, after all.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

490
00:43:19,880 --> 00:43:22,920
<font color="#ffffff">If you're done packing,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">hurry and come down.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

491
00:43:36,600 --> 00:43:39,640
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh, I was actually rooting</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for a kissing scene.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

492
00:44:01,360 --> 00:44:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">What is wrong with me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:44:03,160 --> 00:44:04,800
<font color="#ffffff">This is so crazy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

494
00:44:46,760 --> 00:44:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">I've found them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

495
00:44:49,080 --> 00:44:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">Keep an eye on them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:44:50,840 --> 00:44:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">As soon as they leave, follow them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

497
00:44:53,680 --> 00:44:55,160
<font color="#ffffff">Understood.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:45:08,800 --> 00:45:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek has deceived you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

499
00:45:11,480 --> 00:45:13,120
<font color="#ffffff">They're making a run for it now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:45:14,800 --> 00:45:16,520
